      "mitigation": "Implementation of multi-factor authentication and regular penetration testing to ensure secure integration"
    }
  ],
  "answers_to_questions": [
    "The chatbot's accuracy in handling healthcare data will be validated through regular audits and integration with human support team to catch any potential errors.",
    "The identity management system integration will achieve the necessary security certifications, such as SOC 2, to ensure compliance.",
    "To manage the increased workload on remaining support staff during the transition period, we will provide additional training and resources to help them adapt to their new roles."
  ],
  "remaining_limitations": [
